WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.595
The Workshop brings
your club’s ideas together.

00:00:02.595 --> 00:00:06.833
Compare a combination
of contributors.

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:11.560
Open its How We Bat preview.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:18.050
Check the approach
for each playing format.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.517
The Philosophy Lead
chooses the club’s version.

00:00:22.517 --> 00:00:25.777
Review the wording next,
then confirm it for the season.
